tools/tool-templates/SPEC.md:56:**The format follows Claude Code's, because it already exists and he already reads it.** His `.mcp.json` today is `{"mcpServers": {"<name>": {...}}}`, where a stdio entry carries `command`, `args` and `env`, and an http entry carries `url`. Reusing that shape means no second mental model, and it means an entry can be moved between the two files by copy and paste.
